---RAM* program---
PC=10
 1: +000     Multiplies two integers.                                         
 2: +000     Input:  first number may be any integer within range,            
 3: +000             but the second must be a positive integer.               
 4: +000 -                                                                    
 5: +000 -                                                                    
 6: +000 -                                                                    
 7: +000 -                                                                    
 8: +000 -                                                                    
 9: +000 -                                                                    
10: +030     (30)<-input         | A=input                                    
11: +604     ACC<-(ACC)/10000    |                                            
12: +331     (31)<-(ACC)         | Z=0                                        
13: +032     (32)<-input         | B=input                                    
14: +232     ACC<-(32)           |            --------|                       
15: +500     ACC<-(ACC)-10       |                    |                       
16: +332     (32)<-(ACC)         | --B                |---Add A to Z,         
17: +822     goto 22, if (ACC)<0 | If B<0, goto (22)  |   B times.            
18: +231     ACC<-(31)           |                    |                       
19: +430     ACC<-(ACC)+(30)     |                    |                       
20: +331     (31)<-(ACC)         | Z=Z+A              |                       
21: +714     goto 14             | Goto (14)  --------|                       
22: +131     output (31)         | Output Z                                   
23: +910     PC<-10 and quit     | Quit                                       
